  m_Name: WyrDragonDino
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.Dilemma
  _id: wyr_dragon_dino
  _verb: 0
  _weight: 0
  _narratorPrompt: 'You get one impossible little pet, forever, and it will not shut up about being impossible. Would you rather have a [amber]pet dragon the size of a cat[/amber], smug, fireproof, sets the curtains alight when excited, or a [amber]pet dinosaur the size of a dog[/amber], sweet, dim, and extinct on a technicality. One or the other. Pick.'
  _choices:
  - _id: dragon
    _label: The tiny dragon
    _narratorReact: 'The dragon, then. Of course, the one that could burn the flat down and knows it. You want the pet that might kill you if it sneezed. Fireproof curtains for you. Very telling.'
    _narratorReactStruck:
    _struckParty:
    _gambledParty:
    _route: straight
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 54
    _endsGame: 0
    _profileImpact: []
  - _id: dino
    _label: The tiny dinosaur
    _narratorReact: 'The dinosaur, then. You went for the sweet dim one that history already gave up on. Loyal, doomed, and absolutely going to eat your shoes. You did not want a threat, you wanted a friend with a tragic backstory. Fair.'
    _narratorReactStruck:
    _struckParty:
    _gambledParty:
    _route: straight
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 46
    _endsGame: 0
    _profileImpact: []
